<title>ITALY: Milan Bourse working on hitch, more news at 11 GMT.</title>
<headline>Milan Bourse working on hitch, more news at 11 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Milan stock exchange's computer centre said it is working to get the screen-based trading system up and running and expects to be able to say when the session will start at around 1100 GMT.</p>
<p>Trading, which usually starts at 0900 GMT, was been delayed indefinitely due to technical problems.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
